{
  "$comment": "TORTURE template metadata. Fictional service whose only purpose is to exercise every authoring gotcha we already paid for (see build_torture_poc.py). This is the baseline the Word add-in spike must reproduce: whatever the add-in writes into customXml must round-trip to this shape.",
